{"_id":"6a2ff4ad2204ffbc59e5a56c","roadmapSlug":"python-data-analysis","nodeId":"18eitPvBQKdeM3K33d59g","description":"# Polars\n\nPolars is a fast DataFrame library for Python written in Rust. It is designed as a high-performance alternative to Pandas, with a more consistent API and significantly better performance on large datasets. Polars uses lazy evaluation and query optimization to process data efficiently without loading everything into memory at once.","resources":[{"type":"official","title":"Getting started","url":"https://docs.pola.rs/user-guide/getting-started/","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebac"},{"type":"video","title":"Learning the Polars DataFrame Library!","url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OTVDmA6CRlQ","_id":"6a75d326b0650226a50aebad"}],"createdAt":"2026-06-15T12:48:45.374Z","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T12:44:22.099Z","lessonPacks":[],"paidResources":[{"_id":"6a5e3360acf8c05faf5e1c2a","title":"DataCamp - Data Analyst with Python","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/QY0dY9"},{"_id":"6a5e3365acf8c05faf5e1ded","title":"DataCamp - Python Data Fundamentals","partner":"DataCamp","type":"course","url":"https://datacamp.pxf.io/k4V24x"}],"contribution":"https://github.com/kamranahmedse/developer-roadmap/tree/master/roadmaps/python-data-analysis/content/18eitPvBQKdeM3K33d59g.md"}